-he\">המלצות על ספריא<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n            <li><a id=\"metrics\" href=\"/metrics\">\n                    <span class=\"int-en\">Metrics<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\n                    <span class=\"int-he\">מדדים<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n            <li><a id=\"updates\" href=\"/updates\">\n                    <span class=\"int-en\">New Additions<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\n                    <span class=\"int-he\">עדכונים<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n            <li><a id=\"link-to-annual-report\" href=\"/link-to-annual-report\">\n                    <span class=\"int-en\">Annual Report<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\n                    <span class=\"int-he\">דו&quot;ח שנתי<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n            <li><a id=\"terms\" href=\"/terms\">\n                    <span class=\"int-en\">Terms of Use<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\n                    <span class=\"int-he\">תנאי שימוש<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n            <li><a id=\"privacy-policy\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">\n                    <span class=\"int-en\">Privacy Policy<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\n                    <span class=\"int-he\">מדיניות פרטיות<i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></span></a></li>\n            \n        </ul>\n    </nav>\n<script>\n  const mobile = \"False\" === \"True\";\n  if (!mobile) {\n      const whichPage = \"products\";\n      const item = document.getElementById(whichPage);\n      item.className = 'selected';\n      const aboutSidebar = document.getElementById(\"aboutSidebar\");\n      aboutSidebar.className = `${whichPage}`;\n  }\n  else {\n      const aboutSidebar = document.getElementById(\"aboutSidebar\");\n      aboutSidebar.className = 'mobileAbout';\n  }\n</script>